2496 0 obj
<<
/Title (The revenue contribution was only slightly higher than that of the other countries, ranging from 12.19% to 16.44%. This indicates a well-balanced market portfolio, where overall business performance is supported by multiple markets rather than relying heavily on a single country)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2319 0 R
>>
endobj
2497 0 obj
<<
/Title (UAE recorded the highest values across key sales metrics, including revenue, transaction volume, units sold, and revenue efficiency metrics. However, the differences compared with the other markets were relatively small, indicating a broadly similar level of performance across countries)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2320 0 R
/Next 2540 0 R
>>
endobj
2498 0 obj
<<
